# Build-context exclusions for backend/Dockerfile.
#
# The context is the whole example directory, so everything belonging to the
# front end, to the spec or to local tooling would otherwise be uploaded to the
# daemon for a build that only ever copies backend/pom.xml, backend/mvnw,
# backend/.mvn and backend/src.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
frontend
local
spec
backend/target
backend/.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
backend/.mvn/wrapper/MavenWrapperDownloader.class
backend/.idea
backend/*.iml
